{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方占据绝大部分空间的白色大字号长段文字，首先吸引视线；右上角蓝色加粗的「幸福里也生出疼」是次要入口。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"不确定\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"幸福中夹杂着疼痛、担忧。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他在亲密关系中越来越害怕对方有一天不再需要自己，也担心这份幸福无法持续；想靠近、想表达喜欢，却又害怕失去。幸福与不安并存的具体关系需要读长段文字才能理解。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"单块太长，一块里有好几层意思，包含期待、担忧、自我克制、幸福与悲伤等多个层次。\",\n    \"核心处境没有被单独突出，必须从长段文字中寻找「怕对方哪天不再需要他」等信息才能判断。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "244ae2b2-0dfe-43ec-9f37-735776bc4e34", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T014656867123Z", "elapsed_seconds": 39.016, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:47:35.883318+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ac39efa88abb3dda302543230366561227ab3c107d34808358189dc4f8681296", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885